'''Worker Rail Route 213''' was a [[train]] line located on the [[planet]] [[Bracca]], utilized by the [[Scrapper Guild]]. After the former [[Jedi]] [[Padawan]] [[Cal Kestis]] was discovered by the [[Galactic Empire]]'s [[Inquisitorius]], he was pursued along a train on Worker Rail Route 213.<ref name="Jedi Fallen Order" />

